			</span></i>; freq. of a <i>temple</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔστι
				δὲ ἐν τῷ τεμένεϊ . . ἱρόν κτλ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.112
			</span></i>; of the Jewish temple, <i><span class="en">
