			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱεροί,</span>
			οἱ, members of a religious college or
			guild, ib.<i><span class="en">
				5(1).1390.1
			</span></i>, al. (Andania, <span class="entity">i B.C.</span>), prob. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1010.7
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Chalcedon</span>), etc.; also of women,
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱεραί</span></b> , αἱ, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(1)
			</span></i>. l.c., cf. <i><span class="en">
